  "semantics": "Revision-pinned native vertex and tangent intents on editable vector paths. One atomic edit and one undo entry, or a byte-preserving no-op. Detached paged geometry and preview use query.document.object with the closed subselect selector. Unsupported geometry consumers return unavailable; no JavaScript or Paper writer fallback. Installed acceptance remains pending.",
